# Core engineering

- Follow `.cursor/skills/secure-production-engineering/SKILL.md`.
- Prefer simple, typed, reusable, minimal code over verbose or clever code.
- Inspect existing patterns before creating new ones; reuse over re-implementation.
- Do not generate code that bypasses security, tests, or architecture rules.
- Keep the change set as small as the task allows.
- Before completing a task, self-review against
  `.cursor/skills/secure-production-engineering/resources/code-review-checklist.md`.

For deeper guidance load:
`resources/core-engineering-principles.md`, `resources/architecture-and-reuse.md`,
`resources/anti-patterns.md`.
